    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, you're speaking with Sarah at VeloFit. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961587266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36890,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961591999999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Could I get your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961593999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Walsh. Order number is VF886-012.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36890,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961599999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mark. One moment... Okay, I see your order for the Velo-Carbon cycling shoes. What specifically is the issue with them?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961602733332
    },
    {
      "text": "They don't work for me.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36890,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961611599998
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. To understand better, is it a technical fault with the shoes or a preference issue? For example, are the cleats not fitting your pedals correctly?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961613333331
    },
    {
      "text": "The cleats are fine. The shoes just give me blisters on every ride. They're useless.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36890,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961624866664
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand completely. Getting blisters is the last thing you want from a new pair of cycling shoes. Let me just pull up your delivery date and check the policy for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961630666664
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36890,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961642266664
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, looks like they were delivered 23 days ago. Our policy allows for returns within 90 days, so you're well within that window. I can absolutely process a full refund for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961642966664
    },
    {
      "text": "Right. A refund. Great.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36890,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961655033330
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I'm processing that for you now. I'll email you a prepaid return label immediately. And Mark, I see you're a VIP member with us. We really value your business, and I'm sorry this pair didn't work out. As a courtesy, I've added a $25 credit to your account for your next purchase.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961656766663
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Just send the label.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36890,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764961675899996
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. The email with the label is on its way to your inbox now. Once we receive the return, we'll issue that refund. Was there anything else I could assist with?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
